# console-poison-thresholds.env — wasm 毒化判活阈值【单源】(2026-08-30 J2, NWT §7① 裁: 与 KANet-UI 盯守的 CAPPED=4000 同源, 两处不许各写一份)
# 读者: scripts/kanet-console-supervisor.sh (poison_p2, 只 grep 数字 key 不 source) + KANet-UI 盯守脚本 (待接).
# 语义: wasmBytes >= WASM_CAPPED_MB 且最近 WASM_FROZEN_WINDOW_SEC 内变化 < WASM_FROZEN_DELTA_MB ⇒ 毒化(grow 失败后冻结).
# 只允许 KEY=数字 行; 改值走报备(它决定 supervisor 何时判死 SYSTEM console).
WASM_CAPPED_MB=4000
WASM_FROZEN_WINDOW_SEC=600
WASM_FROZEN_DELTA_MB=1
